 format files\n✔ 13+ Free Book Cover\n✔ You can resize when you design.\n\nFEATURES:\n✔ 300 DPI High Resolution Coloring Pages\n✔ High-quality, print-ready PDF\n✔ Includes 55 EPS, PDF, PNG, and JPG, formats\n✔ 300 DPI Files\n\nNote: You can sell on it amazon KDP and anywhere.\nAll images is very good….\n\nfor your purchase. We hope you will enjoy our creative pictures.\n\n💖 Thank you so much for your purchase, and welcome to my store! 🥰💖",
